# Runtime outputs and local configuration; docs/site contains the published evidence copies.
**/.venv/
**/.asset-venv/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.py[cod]
.pytest_cache/
**/.ruff_cache/
**/*.egg-info/
**/runs/
**/downloaded/
**/cache/
**/wheels/
**/policy/
**/*.pt
**/*.npz
**/*.tar.gz
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
artifacts/downloads/
artifacts/release/
data-cache/
